# Default reviewer for all paths. Specific paths below are highlighted
# defensively — even though the same person reviews everything today,
# splitting the rules makes the privileged paths visible at a glance and
# survives a future maintainer joining without context.
* @Ogguz

# Files with access to release secrets (id-token signing, tap PAT). A
# malicious PR that tweaks the release workflow could exfiltrate the tap
# token or sign attacker-supplied binaries — explicit ownership on these
# paths flags any change for extra scrutiny rather than rubber-stamping
# alongside a doc update.
/.github/workflows/release.yml @Ogguz
/.goreleaser.yml @Ogguz
